icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/121.0.6167.139/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"232bfda57eb92060aacfa892ed2257b44038236134b53984fc8447277821fb2a"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/121.0.6167.139/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"720c4ae0f9abf2cc171a98f6f45e69fa00df8447ff29a182842cf346bd7bf0b3"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/121.0.6167.139/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"546fa17ef8695a5766f234fe94670a0e689bcda9ad125451a5e455e1e2b4e814"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"121.0.6167.139"}